# Root constraints for the exact production Telegram publisher runtime.
#
# requirements/telegram-publisher.txt is the installable SHA-256 hash lock and
# must be refreshed as one resolved closure from these roots. Do not update a
# transitive line in the hash lock independently.
#
# A lock refresh is accepted only after the exact regenerated lock installs in
# the isolated Python 3.11 runtime and passes pip check, guarded CLI smoke, and
# dependency audit in full CI.

